{"baseRefOid":"6c26073d161210af4baedd7dd34737b94efa780f","comments":[{"id":"IC_kwDOTZw3DM8AAAABZ5ZkLQ","author":{"login":"DengZhiyuan-math"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"#132 第三档重跑时发现本 PR 的一个问题，合并前需要处理。\n\n**问题：** ADR-0020 规定定义正文是 \"Markdown with `$…$` maths\"，页面也按 Markdown 渲染。但 `vault.write_working_proof` 把正文原样插进 `proof.tex` 的 `\\paragraph{<term>.}` 后面，所以 Markdown 标记会原样出现在 LaTeX 里。\n\n- **证据：** 第一版建立脚本里，定义写了 `A **release unit** …` 和 `(see *Fixed arrival sequence*)`。生成的 `proof.tex` 里就是 `A **release unit**`，编译后 PDF 显示的是星号。\n- **绕过办法：** 重跑时我删掉了定义里的 Markdown 标记，只用纯文字和 `$…$`。\n\n**两个修法：**\n- 写入 `proof.tex` 时，把少量 Markdown 转成 LaTeX，比如 `**x**` 转成 `\\textbf{x}`，`*x*` 转成 `\\emph{x}`。\n- 或者在 ADR 和 CLI 帮助里规定，定义正文只用纯文字加 `$…$`，和陈述的约定一致；`definition add` 遇到 Markdown 强调时给出提示。\n\n我倾向第二种，它和陈述的写法一致，也最简单。","createdAt":"2026-10-07T07:09:57Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/DengZhiyuan-math/proof-cli/pull/184#issuecomment-6032876589","viewerDidAuthor":true}],"files":[{"path":".agents/skills/proof-cli/SKILL.md","additions":2,"deletions":1,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"CONTEXT.md","additions":5,"deletions":1,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"README.md","additions":11,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"docs/adr/0020-definitions.md","additions":33,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"src/proof_cli/cli.py","additions":105,"deletions":3,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/proof_cli/definitions.py","additions":144,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"src/proof_cli/domain.py","additions":16,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/proof_cli/errors.py","additions":7,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/proof_cli/exchange.py","additions":33,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/proof_cli/proof_map.py","additions":33,"deletions":12,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/proof_cli/rendering.py","additions":36,"deletions":0,"changeType":"M